y the U.S. government to loosen export controls on advanced AI chips”\n….you might be schtupping a spy https://t.co/Zh9jrvHGL0", "url": "https://x.com/Michael04379281/status/2119778181330989508"}, {"author_id": "1393973076220596227", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119587776425525670"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/foxnews/status…", "end": 212, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/foxnews/status/2119550964520669426", "start": 189, "url": "https://t.co/pEXE2fgWCg"}]}, "id": "2119587776425525670", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119550964520669426", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The facts are relevant because Jensen was lobbying Trump for China to have more access to their latest AI chips and tech, trying to loosen the current US export controls on the technology. https://t.co/pEXE2fgWCg", "url": "https://x.com/KeiferStreet/status/2119587776425525670"}, {"author_id": "42343812", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:19:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120174404202074156", "2120174614877757774"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mmjukic/status…", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mmjukic/status/2119923525050130628", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/PWo1ktwId3"}]}, "id": "2120174404202074156", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119923525050130628", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Aside from the fact that Alice Huang's company is believed to have funneled advanced chips to China, Jensen's donations to the Trump inaugural ball (and lifting of export controls on H200 chips later), or his aggressive lobbying for looser export controls. \n\nSigned, \"Nobody\". https://t.co/PWo1ktwId3", "url": "https://x.com/CrispinBurke/status/2120174404202074156"}, {"author_id": "1852910367275724800", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:30:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119890316429775147"], "id": "2119890316429775147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Elizabeth Warren will chair the Senate Banking Committee when Democrats take power in January. She plans to push export controls on advanced AI chips to China and new rules for prediction markets.", "url": "https://x.com/KRYPTOCEAN_/status/2119890316429775147"}, {"author_id": "1665944957167845377", "created_at": "2026-11-09T05:48:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119668411190112501"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 247, "start": 240, "tag": "NVIDIA"}, {"end": 251, "start": 248, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2119668411190112501", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 600,000 NVIDIA H200 chips are reportedly awaiting China's import approval in Hong Kong.\n\nThe bigger picture:\n🇺🇸 US export controls\n🇨🇳 China's domestic chip push\n🤖 Rising AI demand\n\nThe AI race is about technology, trade and geopolitics.\n\n#NVIDIA #AI", "url": "https://x.com/Growthanuruddh/status/2119668411190112501"}, {"author_id": "2094765522223013888", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:22:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119767467308237032"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/nytimes/status…", "end": 242, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/nytimes/status/2119522888067801560", "start": 219, "url": "https://t.co/vjKY7X6JUA"}]}, "id": "2119767467308237032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119522888067801560", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Washington spent years restricting NVDA's AI chips from reaching China, tightening export controls and trying to close loopholes.\nApparently Beijing tried a workaround that's 5000+ years old.\nAnd, allegedly, it worked. https://t.co/vjKY7X6JUA", "url": "https://x.com/marcogarax/status/2119767467308237032"}, {"author_id": "1396164776045289474", "created_at": "2026-11-09T18:55:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119866410411397167"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 242, "start": 235, "tag": "Nvidia"}, {"end": 246, "start": 243, "tag": "AI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/2BcnGIq3Ap", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/creativecontri/status/2119866410411397167/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119865382144253952", "start": 247, "url": "https://t.co/2BcnGIq3Ap"}]}, "id": "2119866410411397167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia has launched an independent investigation into reports its CEO was targeted by a foreign intelligence effort. China rejects the allegations. The case raises new questions about AI chips, export controls and technology security. #Nvidia #AI https://t.co/2BcnGIq3Ap", "url": "https://x.com/creativecontri/status/2119866410411397167"}, {"author_id": "2119707002058518529", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:31:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120207661002260912"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 205, "start": 190, "tag": "ExportControls"}, {"end": 221, "start": 206, "tag": "Semiconductors"}]}, "id": "2120207661002260912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When governments tighten export controls on chips and AI, the know-how doesn't become less valuable. It becomes more valuable. Expect more effort aimed at the people who hold it, not less.\n\n#ExportControls #Semiconductors", "url": "https://x.com/honeypotbuster/status/2120207661002260912"}, {"author_id": "309428222", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:08:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120186945204560001", "2120199802491445339"], "id": "2120186945204560001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 154, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It's still early, but the domestic impact, if the US government follows through on stronger export controls in the wake of the Jensen-MSS scandal, is becoming clear:\n- greater supply and bargaining power for US companies that need more AI chips\n- more fab capacity at TSMC for", "url": "https://x.com/lorandlaskai/status/2120186945204560001"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2097825110094979072", "name": "The AI Bandwagon", "username": "AIBandwagon"}, {"id": "3126840508", "name": "😊", "username": "alwayslearni"}, {"id": "2010272031603068928", "name": "Alexey Fateev", "username": "superalesha"}, {"id": "2962449658", "name": "Anni Sen", "username": "anni_sen"}, {"id": "1822806541969522688", "name": "HW.Seo", "username": "SeohyeongW70998"}, {"id": "2118730841484341248", "name": "The Wolf", "username": "YallStreetWolf"}, {"id": "2091300144419577856", "name": "Unc GPT", "username": "Unc_GPT"}, {"id": "1438398783092494341", "name": "IndianBoba", "username": "indianboba"}, {"id": "1586780475309182977", "name": "Icarus", "username": "CoinerHermes"}, {"id": "1444799468", "name": "Stephen Loynd", "username": "loyndsview"}, {"id": "2008007686458429441", "name": "Beverly Downs", "username": "DownsBever66819"}, {"id": "1230508295942737920", "name": "M82", "username": "MolinaHoldings"}, {"id": "42343812", "name": "Crispin Burke", "username": "CrispinBurke"}, {"id": "2773130774", "name": "Anthony Samrani", "username": "AnthonySamrani"}, {"id": "28172926", "name": "WSJ Tech", "username": "WSJTech"}, {"id": "950444449003384834", "name": "TLC", "username": "camp_terrence"}, {"id": "1525457354770325504", "name": "IfYouCanKeepIt", "username": "Michael04379281"}, {"id": "1393973076220596227", "name": "Keifer Street", "user